Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.47,0:00:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on the move!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.59,0:01:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.53,0:01:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,the KC Grand Championship is\Nproud to present two duelists
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.59,0:01:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,who have ridden the wave of\Nvictory all the way to the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.97,0:01:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,First, the debonair\Nbillionaire, Siegfried Lloyd.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.39,0:01:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It means the rookie who's won\Nthe top cookie, Leon Wilson.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.73,0:01:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The winner of this bout\Nis bound to make a splash
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.97,0:01:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,when he faces Yugi Moto\Nfor the championship crown!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.21,0:01:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, folks,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.73,0:01:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,history could be made in\Nthe next few hours if this
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.91,0:01:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,coveted title changes hands\Nhere in the Kaiba Dome!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.77,0:01:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, without further ado, let the\NKC Grand Championship Finals begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.49,0:02:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,For those about to duel, we salute you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.65,0:02:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.65,0:02:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Just dropping by?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.13,0:02:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but why?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.55,0:02:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Sector wasn't scheduled to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.31,0:02:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What an unexpected treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.11,0:02:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You're mine, Siegfried.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.57,0:02:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop the duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.49,0:02:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,As president of Kaiba Corp,\NI declare this match invalid.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.47,0:02:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't rip us off like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.19,0:02:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he just did.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.49,0:02:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Invalid?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.55,0:02:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.97,0:02:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,As the result of a disqualification,\Nthe winner of this duel is Leon Wilson!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.95,0:02:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.86,0:02:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I won?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.97,0:02:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Any particular reason for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.83,0:02:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Humor me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.27,0:03:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You broke your tournament contract by\Nentering the event under a false name,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.91,0:03:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Siegfried Lloyd.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.17,0:03:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Or should I say Siegfried von\NSchroeder of the Schroeder Corporation?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.83,0:03:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.41,0:03:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Schroeder Corp?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.99,0:03:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Wasn't that an old gaming\Ncompany or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.21,0:03:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, it still is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.65,0:03:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You just don't hear much about it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.17,0:03:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Once KaibaCorp became number one, everyone\Nsort of forgot about the Schroders.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.65,0:03:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you think Siegfried\Njoined to get revenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.01,0:03:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I never trusted you from\Nthe get-go, Siegfried.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.33,0:03:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And my instincts are never wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.95,0:03:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It all makes perfect sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.43,0:03:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,KaibaCorp's biggest rival\Njoins the tournament,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.75,0:03:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,and suddenly everything goes haywire.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.25,0:03:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Coincidence?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.16,0:03:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I think not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.87,0:03:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But since I'm a nice guy, I won't have\Nyou arrested for trespassing and fraud.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.41,0:04:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Under one condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.41,0:04:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You get out of my life and\Ntake your bad hair with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.77,0:04:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And mark my words, if your overpriced\Nshoes step anywhere near me again,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.75,0:04:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll destroy what's left\Nof your pathetic company!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.45,0:04:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like you've finally been\Nexposed to the public for what you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.05,0:04:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,A complete coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.83,0:04:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth is you're afraid\Nof my superior skills,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.13,0:04:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,so you're hiding behind a\Ntechnicality instead of facing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.07,0:04:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And now the whole world knows it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.79,0:04:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't blame you for\Nthrowing me out, Herr Kyber.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.93,0:04:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You know that if I won this tournament\Nand became the world champion,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.87,0:04:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,you would never win that title back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.53,0:04:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm throwing you out because I don't\Nlike you, not because I'm scared of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.17,0:04:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I promised myself I\Nwouldn't duel in this tournament,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.03,0:05:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,but since I have the\Nchance to embarrass you...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.03,0:05:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Those plans have changed!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.77,0:05:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuiper's gonna duel Siegfried!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.69,0:05:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, there's never a dull moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.53,0:05:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, but if I win, I get to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.77,0:05:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you lose, you disappear,\Nnever to be heard from again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.39,0:05:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.51,0:05:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.99,0:05:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto's gonna blast him\Nto the minor league.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.91,0:05:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, hold this. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.43,0:05:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This shouldn't take too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.19,0:05:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Last chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.49,0:05:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure you want to go through with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.81,0:05:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.72,0:05:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.63,0:05:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I ever pass this up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.89,0:05:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not every day I get to destroy my\Narch rival in front of the entire world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.73,0:05:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But who should go first?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.13,0:05:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess there's only\None fair way to decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.83,0:05:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Siegfried.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.71,0:05:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Your call.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.07,0:05:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'll go with Lance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.55,0:06:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.46,0:06:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.45,0:06:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But I think I'll let you\Ngo first, Herr Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.43,0:06:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.34,0:06:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I never knew you were so kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.51,0:06:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I'll have to return the favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.89,0:06:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need, I insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.41,0:06:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, there's been a\Nslight change of plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.57,0:06:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, your tournament host,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.53,0:06:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Santo Kaiba will face up against\NSiegfried Ball Schroeder!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.65,0:06:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Zato!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.56,0:06:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to show this circus freak who's born!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.19,0:06:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,How's it going, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.67,0:06:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Leon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.89,0:06:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,So what's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.25,0:06:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, am I gonna duel against\Nyou or against Siegfried?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.33,0:06:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess it all depends on how\Nwell Kaiba does in this next duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.41,0:06:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope he wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.69,0:07:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't worry about it, because\NI'm sure no matter who wins,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.25,0:07:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll get your chance to duel\NYugi for the championship Unless,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.31,0:07:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,of course, you want to give me\Nyour space in the tournament
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.73,0:07:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'll pass. You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.51,0:07:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,as much as I can't stand Kaiba,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.77,0:07:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,anyone's better than that\Npink-haired sideshow freak Siegfried
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.97,0:07:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ditto
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.37,0:07:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The grand championship bonus\Nmatch is about to begin
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.83,0:07:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And my most devastating flower\Nis about to blossom, Herr Khyber.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.29,0:07:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Competitors, take your\Nmarks and ready your decks!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.73,0:07:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what it is you're after,\NSiegfried, but I do know it all ends here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.39,0:07:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.29,0:07:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Now to kick things off with a bang, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.75,0:08:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,X-Head Cannon in attack mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.67,0:08:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I'll play two cards\Nface down and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.97,0:08:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You sound so confident.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.15,0:08:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm afraid those little mechanical\Ntoys of yours are nothing but
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.33,0:08:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,insignificant seedlings that are about\Nto be uprooted by my raging wildflowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.83,0:08:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.07,0:08:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,These people came here to see a\Nduel, not a bad poetry reading.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.61,0:08:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's move on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.25,0:08:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.45,0:08:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The true beauty of my\Nmaidens of mayhem can best
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.81,0:08:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,be appreciated if I simply\Ncall them to the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.87,0:08:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,So witness poetry in motion as\NI play Ride of the Valkyries!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.17,0:08:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This allows me to summon every\NValkyrie in my hand. Already?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.79,0:08:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Give a big Khyberland welcome to Valkyrie\NZwei, Valkyrie Öster and Valkyrie Dritt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.69,0:08:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to my Valkyrie\NZwei's special effect,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.17,0:09:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,your cannon goes straight\Nto the graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.97,0:09:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's not all. Next,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.05,0:09:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,my Valkyrie Öster removes\Nyour cannon from the game
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.05,0:09:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,for good and gains the\Nequivalent of its attack string.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.31,0:09:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And finally, my Valkyrie\NDritter's special effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.89,0:09:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,For each opposing monster removed from\Nthe game, her strength increases by 100.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.79,0:09:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,He's summoned three monsters at once,\Nand Kaiba's life points are defenseless.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.69,0:09:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,So if Siegfried attacks with all\Nthree Valkyries, the duel's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.77,0:09:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.11,0:09:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like we've reached the\Nfinale before we've even begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.39,0:09:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Our Vida sends...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.63,0:09:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Valkyrie's Vive!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.37,0:09:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack his life point\Ndirectly with Galloping Gash!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.17,0:09:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate my face-down card!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.07,0:09:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Go negate attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.65,0:09:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you're out of luck,\Nand your Valkyrie's out of steam.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.29,0:10:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.41,0:10:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to Kaiba's card,\NSiegfried's turn is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.27,0:10:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,So his three Valkyries\Ngo back to his deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.91,0:10:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what are you waiting for, Siegfried?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.91,0:10:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Call off your ponies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.85,0:10:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Their moment in the spotlight is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.37,0:10:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to this card, they've added\Na second performance. Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.17,0:10:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.57,0:10:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for an encore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.39,0:10:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,So why don't you just sit\Nback and enjoy the show?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.63,0:10:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Valkyra, bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.17,0:10:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack him directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.35,0:10:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,He's cheating.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.03,0:10:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, those Valkyries should have\Nreturned to Ziegfried's deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.51,0:10:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.15,0:10:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.35,0:10:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Winning, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.17,0:10:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, Mischief of the Time\NGoddess allows me to skip your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.13,0:10:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I can pick up where I left off, wiping\Nout the remainder of your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.33,0:10:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's try this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.21,0:11:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.15,0:11:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.27,0:11:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I reveal my magical trick mirror!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.31,0:11:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.71,0:11:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It activates a magic\Ncard from your graveyard!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.89,0:11:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And I choose Mischief of the Time Goddess!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.15,0:11:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Not set!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.65,0:11:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see how you like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.73,0:11:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now your turn is skipped!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.07,0:11:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,He just bought himself a second chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.05,0:11:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't screw this up, rich boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.91,0:11:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,If you thought you could\Nwin this duel in one turn,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.39,0:11:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,then you don't know who you're up against!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.55,0:11:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I've come a long way since we were\Nkids, Siegfried, so check this out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.05,0:11:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Z-Metal Tank to\Nthe field, in defense mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.31,0:11:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And next, I'll summon\Nmy Clone Dragon card!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.39,0:11:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It becomes an exact duplicate\Nof the monster I just played,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.59,0:11:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,which gives me two tanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.23,0:12:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That ends my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.65,0:12:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.17,0:12:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The action hasn't stopped since\NKaiba made his first move.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.75,0:12:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, most of the\Naction's been at Kaiba's expense.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.57,0:12:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's gonna get worse, because\NSiegfried's Valkyra are still on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.75,0:12:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you plan to do something besides stall?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.53,0:12:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,because quite frankly\Nyou're becoming something
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.07,0:12:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Of a nuisance to me. We both know you're
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.87,0:12:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,going to lose so why not get it over with\Nhmm that way I can win and still make my
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.51,0:12:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,eight o 'clock massage you nauseate me now
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.39,0:12:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,just make your move\Nnow you're making sense
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.47,0:12:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I activate my\NValkyrie's embrace then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.69,0:12:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I switch my Valkyrie\NDretta to defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.47,0:13:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,By activating my magic card and then\Nswitching one Valkyrie to defense mode,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.67,0:13:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I was able to remove one of\Nyour monsters from the game!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.43,0:13:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And since another one of\Nyour monsters left the game,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.79,0:13:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Valkyrie Dretta's attack streak\Ngoes up by another hundred points.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.97,0:13:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Valkyrie Airsta,\Nattack his clone dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.69,0:13:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Valkyrie Zwei, end this duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.59,0:13:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Back time!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.89,0:13:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.73,0:13:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,He lost almost half his points!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.07,0:13:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and there's more\Nwhere that came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.13,0:13:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all? Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.21,0:13:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, you're not fooling anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.17,0:13:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole world can sense your fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.89,0:13:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And what do you think I'm afraid of?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.75,0:14:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Your ferocious galloping Girl Scouts?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.37,0:14:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see how they hold up\Nagainst my pitch-dark dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.79,0:14:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I place one card\Nface down and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.05,0:14:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.39,0:14:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.61,0:14:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I switch my Valkyrie\NGlitter into attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.59,0:14:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Every single time Kaiba summons a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.87,0:14:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It gets crushed. Just hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.83,0:14:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, let's not lose hope\Nyet. Reveal face down card.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.09,0:14:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Flat level 4. Here's how it works. Now\Nthat my dragon is gone, each of us is able
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.49,0:14:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,to choose a 4-star monster from our deck\Nand summon it directly to the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.57,0:14:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And I choose my Dragon Head!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.63,0:14:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And I think I shall summon\Nanother Valkyrie to join us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.47,0:15:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.57,0:15:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,she gets an immediate\Npower boost since two
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.89,0:15:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,of your monsters have\Nbeen removed from play.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.65,0:15:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,How kind of you to invite another\None of my friends to the soiree.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.97,0:15:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That makes four.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.63,0:15:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, the party's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.89,0:15:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I activate my\NPot of Greed Magic Card.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.07,0:15:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That lets me draw two more cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.53,0:15:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I'll activate my Dimension Fusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.67,0:15:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, once I give up\N2,000 of my life points,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.99,0:15:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm able to bring back my X-Head\NCannon and my Z-Metal Tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.81,0:15:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not those!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.83,0:15:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he'll be able to\Ncombine them together.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.41,0:15:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But he paid 2,000 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.91,0:15:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.47,0:15:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I activate the Magic\NCard Soul Absorption.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.25,0:15:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,This gives me an\Nadditional 500 life points
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.85,0:15:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,each time a card is removed from the game!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.03,0:15:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'll remove my X-Head Cannon,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.63,0:15:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,my Dragon Head, and my Z-Metal\NTank in order to play this card!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.41,0:16:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,X-Y-Z Dragon Cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.17,0:16:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,not only was he able to\Nsummon a really powerful
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.35,0:16:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,monster to the field he\Nwas also able to gain
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.47,0:16:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,back 1500 life points this\Ncould be just the break
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.87,0:16:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,kaiba needed to make his\Ncomeback let's hope so
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.71,0:16:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,all right siegfried it's time\Nto get rid of your little
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.59,0:16:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,friend along with the horse she\Nrode in on Dragon Cannon, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.09,0:16:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.15,0:16:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice move.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.33,0:16:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,He totally caught Siegfried off guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.49,0:16:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.83,0:16:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Always one step ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.01,0:16:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,One step ahead?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.43,0:16:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I swore that would never happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.37,0:16:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.63,0:16:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to him, the gaming\Nindustry will never be the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.85,0:16:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto Kaiba's a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.29,0:16:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.25,0:17:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.71,0:17:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, great. You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.09,0:17:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That idea belongs to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.85,0:17:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,He's beat me to the\Npunch for the last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.67,0:17:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba's not out of trouble yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.53,0:17:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And now it's Siegfried's turn again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.65,0:17:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, how to destroy you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.01,0:17:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I think Nibelung's\Ntreasure is a good start.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.45,0:17:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.99,0:17:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that the same card\Nhe used to do you in?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.49,0:17:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.47,0:17:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's not a fond memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.91,0:17:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,This lets me play Nibelung's ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.17,0:17:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But since I'm feeling generous,\NI'll give it to your dragon cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.31,0:17:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I also get to draw five new cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.27,0:17:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And my ring stops your\Nmonster from attacking me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.55,0:17:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,So much for your big, bad\Ndragon cannon savings a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.41,0:18:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And it gets worse, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.63,0:18:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, Kaiba has to draw\Ntwo cards from his deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.33,0:18:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And if either one is a monster card,\Nhe has to remove it from the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.61,0:18:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I sacrifice my Valkyrie Dritter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.49,0:18:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That lets me call forth the\Ninstrument of your destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.83,0:18:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.74,0:18:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, it's my Fortune Chariot!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.35,0:18:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's come to cart\Nyou away into oblivion!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.09,0:18:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that my Valkyrie Zwei has taken the\Ndriver's seat, the real fun can begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.95,0:18:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,By reducing my monster's\Nstrength for one turn,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.49,0:18:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortune Chariot allows her\Ncertain, shall we say, privileges.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.59,0:18:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,For instance, my Valkyrie can bypass\Nyour dragon and attack you directly!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.49,0:18:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.95,0:19:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Valkyrie spy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.89,0:19:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack Herr Kaiba's life points!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.17,0:19:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.39,0:19:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.73,0:19:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,As a rule, I usually refrain from\Nkicking a man when he's down,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.63,0:19:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,but for you I'll make an exception.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.55,0:19:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,So go, mystical space typhoon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.05,0:19:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I'll play this and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.19,0:19:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see what I did, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.79,0:19:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Since I just destroyed your\Nsoul-absorption magic card,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.75,0:19:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,you can't replenish your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.95,0:19:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And as long as my fortune\Nchariot is in play,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.27,0:19:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I can continue to chip away at your\Nlife points until you have nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.49,0:19:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Now who's one step ahead, Herr Khyber?
